# Venue requirements: ICLR 2027 main conference (double-blind)

Supersedes the NeurIPS 2026 record of the previous world (still in git history; the paper must be re-based on the ICLR template).
Objective: venue-repo#7, "ready to submit to ICLR 2027 ... the LaTeX source in the ICLR 2027 template, the compiled PDF, and the code and
experimental results that the paper's claims rest on", using nothing first published after **18 October 2026**.

